    routePath: 'indian-poker-lame-brain-pete',
    LLM: 'Game: Lame Brain Pete. Logic: 3 hole cards, 4 community cards revealed sequentially. Wild card = lowest rank among all 4 community cards (determined after 4th card). Betting rounds after hole cards and after each community card. Standard poker hand evaluation with wild cards.',
    Player: "Welcome to Lame Brain Pete. You'll get three hole cards and watch four community cards appear one by one. But here's the twistâ€”the lowest card showing on the board becomes wild at the end. Will your hand improve or fall apart? Bet wisely and remember: in this game, patience is often rewarded.",
    tagline: 'Where the wild card is always a surprise.',
