    aiContent: {
      difficulty: {
        easy: "Bets based only on current hand strength without considering potential wild cards. Folds too easily when community cards don't match hole cards.",
        medium: 'Calculates basic probabilities of hole cards becoming wild. Understands that connected low cards have good wild card potential.',
        hard: 'Expert at calculating wild card probabilities based on exposed community cards. Adjusts betting strategy dynamically as each card is revealed. Masters the art of representing strong hands when the wild card favors their range.',
      },
      considerations: [
        'Wild card probability changes with each revealed community card.',
        'Hand strength can shift dramatically from street to street.',
        'Bluffing opportunities exist when the wild card creates ambiguity about hand strength.',
        'Multi-way pots require careful consideration of how wild cards might help opponents.',
      ],
